ent-PdaAppStoreCartridge = app store cartridge
ent-PdaAppStoreCartridge-desc = A catalogue of approved PDA software. Downloads are validated by the device.

ent-PdaDataDisk = data disk
ent-PdaDataDisk-desc = A removable disk for PDA programs. Slide it into a PDA to read or copy its contents.

ent-PdaDataDiskAdvanced = advanced data disk
ent-PdaDataDiskAdvanced-desc = A high-capacity removable disk for PDA programs.

ent-PdaDataDiskSuper = super data disk
ent-PdaDataDiskSuper-desc = An extra-capacity removable disk for PDA programs.

ent-PdaDataDiskContractor = contractor software disk
ent-PdaDataDiskContractor-desc = A preloaded disk with common contractor PDA programs. Install them or discard it.
